399	## Best Practices
400	
401	### ✅ DO
402	
403	```kotlin
404	// ✅ Use typed API services
405	class UserApi(private val client: HttpClient)
406	
407	// ✅ Wrap calls in result types
408	suspend fun getUser(): ApiResult<User>
409	
410	// ✅ Configure timeouts
411	config { setTimeoutIntervalForRequest(30.0) }
412	
413	// ✅ Add logging for debug builds
414	if (isDebug) { install(Logging) }
415	
416	// ✅ Handle exceptions at boundaries
417	try { api.call() } catch (e: NetworkException) { /* handle */ }
418	```
419	
420	### ❌ DON'T
421	
422	```kotlin
423	// ❌ Don't create multiple HttpClient instances
424	// Use singleton via DI
425	
426	// ❌ Don't block on suspend calls
427	runBlocking { api.call() }  // ❌
428	
429	// ❌ Don't ignore exceptions
430	try { api.call() } catch (e: Exception) { }  // ❌
431	
432	// ❌ Don't hardcode URLs
433	client.get("https://api.example.com/users")  // ❌
434	// Configure base URL in defaultRequest
435	```
436	
437	---
438	
439	**Remember**: Networking is the bridge between your app and the world. Make it robust, testable, and platform-optimized.
